      {
        "id": "blk_d05bba50101048de995dfbe3",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "仓库退货的提交期限为5个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_93f12b712df6fdf3ffb62336",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "仓库退货的审批责任人为物流。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_2bf64c787f80d427f6b14198",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "仓库退货必须提供物流单号。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_e865a27df0673af517d31a4a",
        "kind": "table",
        "text": "仓库退货记录须保留11个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "rows": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_11a100c75e1d7ebb11531225",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "仓库退货的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_11ba33ab36116972aa3ad633",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "仓库退货必须通过退货登记台提交。",
        "anchor": {
